      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is running on whatever thread creates KeepaliveTracker (in the current tree I can only see one caller, in DataNetwork on some handler thread).\n\nHowever, l.908 reads from this mutable data structure, and in your future patches that code is run on the connectivity service handler thread, so it\u0027s a different thread.\n\nThat means l.908 might not see the contents of this SparseArray (java spec 17.5), and you\u0027ll crash when calling sendPollingRequest with a null argument.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 168,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 168,
        "endChar": 97
      },
      "revId": "77098d01321d7e6289489cf111e33b033f4ddaa6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
