      "writtenOn": "2022-12-21T04:14:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Constructing the message does not require permission. I think it does no matter where the KeepaliveTracker is created.\n\nThe exception should be caught in isAnyTcpSocketConnected(). Also, I expect the design should never be run in the KeepaliveTracker created by DataNetwork.\n\nI move the message construction into isAnyTcpSocketConnectedForFamily to create it when it\u0027s really needed to reduce the memory usage for those conditions that does not need it.",
      "parentUuid": "9ed7d0c2_758b02ea",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 168,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 168,
        "endChar": 97
      },
