      "writtenOn": "2022-12-23T10:50:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has nothing to do with permissions, but with threading ; when I say \"might not see the contents\", I mean you might have a case where that thread will see the array empty. It\u0027s a bug.\n\nYour new version will work and indeed will reduce memory usage when this is not needed, but it will also increase churn and power consumption for these cases where it is needed ; maybe you can have the best of these two worlds by only creating the value when you need it, but caching it.",
