      "writtenOn": "2022-12-21T04:14:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need to get type and len, then read the value. We need most of the member inside StructNlAttr. I think parsing it separately does not reduce too much memory usage, so I keep it as it is. Please let me know if you still have concern about this.",
      "parentUuid": "6de2c109_cfeb2e91",
      "range": {
